omakasui-devtools (0.0.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ship the payload once in omakasui-devtools; omakub-devtools and
    omadeb-devtools are now thin packages providing only their command name,
    and no longer conflict with each other.
  * Promote imagemagick and python3-pil to Depends.
  * Add set -euo pipefail to the theme scripts.
  * theme format previews
  * anchor the colors.toml lookups so accent_dim and background_alt are
    no longer matched instead of accent and background.
  * Only list command groups that ship a binary in --help.

 -- Luca Pattocchio <info@lucapattocchio.dev>  Mon, 17 Aug 2026 00:35:00 +0200

